# Build-profile switch retained as a Kconfig symbol for downstream
# consumers that inspect sdkconfig (sdkconfig.defaults sets it to y on
# this fork). It is no longer used to gate source selection: main/
# CMakeLists.txt compiles the demo and PC Controller (BLE HID presenter)
# sources into a single image, and pc_app_main.c provides the sole
# app_main(). The legacy sdkconfig.presenter.defaults layered profile has
# been folded into sdkconfig.defaults so the demo and presenter profiles
# stay in lock-step from a single source of truth.
# Basis: docs/software-design/pc-controller/requirements.md §2.
menu "PC Controller Application"
    config PC_CONTROLLER_APP
        bool "PC Controller (BLE HID presenter) application"
        default y
        help
            Build the PC Controller BLE HID presenter firmware instead of
            the default demo application.
endmenu

menu "BSP Display Options"
    config BSP_LCD_SWAP_BYTES
        bool "LCD byte swap for RGB565 (LVGL LE to SPI BE)"
        default y
        help
          ST7789 面板通过 SPI 接收大端 RGB565，LVGL 输出小端。
          大多数批次需要 swap_bytes=true（默认）。
          当前硬件批次实测需 false，通过 sdkconfig.defaults 覆盖。
          更换面板批次时需重新实测。
endmenu
